	Starting to implement CSV file to ROOT file converter
	* Header file CSV2ROOT.h
	* Source code CSV2ROOT.cxx

2026-10-20 Hanna Palm <ha2684pa-s@student.lu.se>
	Implemented DataPoint class
	* Header file DataPoint.h
	* Source code DataPoint.cxx
	* Changed in main.cxx to test new DataPoint class

	Implemented parse_csv_file function
	* Header file Csv2Tree.h
	* Source code CSv2Ttree.cxx
	- It takes a csv file path and returns a vector of DataPoint objects

	Implemented csv_to_root function
	* Header file Csv2Tree.h
	* Source code CSv2Ttree.cxx
	- It takes a csv file path and saves entries into a TTree format, output file .root

2026-10-22 Hanna Palm <ha2684pa-s@student.lu.se>
	Updated Csc2TTree.cxx to ignore metadata. 
	* Looping over metadata lines in beginning of file and only saves data given after the header.

	Updated DataPoint class by adding private methods + new private variables
	* _split_date() private setter for _year, _month and _day using info from _date.
	* Added getters for _day, _month and _year. 
	* Updated Csv2TTree.cxx to create branches for day, month and year and store that data.
	- Note: seems to be writing root file properly but year parameter might be wrong. So check when we have root reader!

